{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vanquish Evil",
    "steam_appid": 3781740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.poster.avif?t=1754960341\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.webm?t=1754960341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.mp4?t=1754960341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Vanquish Evil throws you into dense forests and flaming rings while unleashing wave after wave of monsters. Feels like a survival gauntlet on overdrive.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- IndieSight <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fast-paced, addictive, and full of variety! The upgrade system keeps each run fresh, and the pixel art style looks fantastic. A must-play for action RPG fans!&quot; <br><br>- Awesome Games Review Group<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>FAST-PACED ACTION ROGUELIKE COMBAT</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil aims to take the most fun core gameplay from the ARPG/Roguelite genres -- and crank up the action to one thousand percent! Where player skill and strategic upgrade choices strongly influence the runs.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE STORY</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supernatural cosmic battle is being fought for the mortal realm, and much of the world is already in ruin.<br><br>A final resistance of humanity are brave enough to fight. Many die, and are turned into undead armies who serve the formless evil cosmic presence known as Absolute Darkness (Vile).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Light (Veil), a cosmic presence in favor of saving humanity, send Cosmic Guardians to fight alongside the mortal armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final elite army of heroes stand together to fight an apocalyptic war with one common goal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GAME DEVELOPMEMENT GOALS</i></strong><br> <br> Creating fun gameplay and high replay value is the goal. The game in it's current state is built to have all character progression in-game for that specific run, which gives the game a lot of replay value. Currently the game has just begun meta progression development. &quot;Meta Items&quot; are now being added as unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SPECIAL FEATURES</strong></i><br><br>Stylized hand-drawn pixel art, animation, and background art!<br>Original Music Soundtrack composed and produced by GnarlyTree!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.poster.avif?t=1754960341\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.webm?t=1754960341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.mp4?t=1754960341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Vanquish Evil throws you into dense forests and flaming rings while unleashing wave after wave of monsters. Feels like a survival gauntlet on overdrive.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- IndieSight <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fast-paced, addictive, and full of variety! The upgrade system keeps each run fresh, and the pixel art style looks fantastic. A must-play for action RPG fans!&quot; <br><br>- Awesome Games Review Group<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>FAST-PACED ACTION ROGUELIKE COMBAT</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil aims to take the most fun core gameplay from the ARPG/Roguelite genres -- and crank up the action to one thousand percent! Where player skill and strategic upgrade choices strongly influence the runs.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE STORY</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supernatural cosmic battle is being fought for the mortal realm, and much of the world is already in ruin.<br><br>A final resistance of humanity are brave enough to fight. Many die, and are turned into undead armies who serve the formless evil cosmic presence known as Absolute Darkness (Vile).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Light (Veil), a cosmic presence in favor of saving humanity, send Cosmic Guardians to fight alongside the mortal armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final elite army of heroes stand together to fight an apocalyptic war with one common goal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GAME DEVELOPMEMENT GOALS</i></strong><br> <br> Creating fun gameplay and high replay value is the goal. The game in it's current state is built to have all character progression in-game for that specific run, which gives the game a lot of replay value. Currently the game has just begun meta progression development. &quot;Meta Items&quot; are now being added as unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SPECIAL FEATURES</strong></i><br><br>Stylized hand-drawn pixel art, animation, and background art!<br>Original Music Soundtrack composed and produced by GnarlyTree!</p>",
    "short_description": "Vanquish Evil is an Action RPG Roguelite! Fast-paced action! A Randomized Upgrade System to choose your own path, and every run is unique! Explosive spell-based and melee upgrades! Stack upgrades for synergy! Features stylized pixel art!",
